          "patch": "@@ -0,0 +1,5 @@\n+def accept(event):\n+    with transaction():\n+        if not insert_event_if_absent(event.id):\n+            return\n+        enqueue(event)\n"
        }
      ],
      "commits": [],
      "reviews": [],
      "comments": []
    },
    "review": "Billing event acceptance stores the event ID and enqueues the event in one transaction. A previously stored ID returns without enqueueing again. This guards the intake path; it does not prove all external charges are exactly-once."
